---
description: "Editing Wander behavior files (.wander) for the Skywalker engine"
globs: ["**/*.wander"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Wander is Skywalker's behavior language. Read it from the engine before writing any: call the `wander_reference` MCP tool (or read the MCP resource `skywalker://docs/WANDER`).
Check source with `wander_check` (or `skywalker check FILE.wander`), attach it with `behavior_set`, and verify by stepping the simulation (`sim_control step`, `sim_trace`, `logs`).
Keep each behavior's `intent` accurate whenever the code changes. See the `skywalker-wander` skill.
